## Description

My friend applied to 250 tech jobs in two years. No MIT. No Stanford.  Last month Anthropic offered him $750,000.  I asked him how he broke in from zero.  He sent me the exact video that got him in. Anthropic's 2-hour course on how to become an AI engineer in 2026.  Thariq https://t.co/b5c5UpJNs4

